    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Some wounds never fully mend. And some memories are never really gone.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>'The Festival Isn't Over'</strong> is a visual-novel adventure game following a retired war veteran, <i>ISHA</i>'s fragmented memories. You, as her companion helps Isha to make choices that will result in bringing her memories back, and further more, change her life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946110/extras/ba714c28b788496aa37cb0605e31ad95.poster.avif?t=1748506688\" width=468 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946110/extras/ba714c28b788496aa37cb0605e31ad95.webm?t=1748506688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946110/extras/ba714c28b788496aa37cb0605e31ad95.mp4?t=1748506688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tracing down the line of memories...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traumatic memories of the war slowly fades away, but Isha is unable to escape the shadows of her past. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the town bustles with activity in preparation for the New Year's festivities, a sense of dread, melancholy, and guilt grips Isha as she seems to be the only one unable to escape the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946110/extras/598cf1b0fa3e70b60c5be8bdf949f35a.avif?t=1748506688\" data-has-big width=800 height=462 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover forgotten memories by tracing down the Memory Thread</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Years of War, all in 7 days of festival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the house and interact with items to find out stories behind them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning visuals and audio of a never-ending festival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 4 Endings based on your interaction with Isha, Visitors and the Apartment.</p></li></ul>",
